本帖为美术鉴赏分贴，由于RD皮肤较多，全放在一起网页加载较慢。</span><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2、RD皮获得方式一般为：当期RD白金箱子、当期RD商店300000硬币购买、RB第一层自选箱子（本期及过往全部），蓝PASS任务达成点数（抽奖箱子）。</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"\">3、最新一期的自选箱子有全部形象预览。</span></div>4、本帖为23年1月开始的皮肤，（RD第43期）</span></span><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line1\"></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">目录</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">该贴按时间排序大家可以使用 Ctrl+F 搜索直达</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/165700.html\" target=\"_blank\">美术鉴赏目录</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">》2、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/166804.html\">氪金皮肤</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">》3、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/166901.html\">活动皮肤</a>》4、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/166918.html\">RB皮肤1</a>》4、《RB皮肤》5、《皮肤塔》6、《常驻形象》7、《温泉皮肤》8、《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/579248.html\">美术八卦</a>》</span></span></span></span></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line2\"></div></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">阿修特雷斯-光裙</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">-女王 23年01月5日 第43期&nbsp;</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_925/1069/107851/2023/0/4/882023.png\" style=\"\" data-width=\"800\" data-height=\"925\"></div>\n                               </div></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2D演出 549×620 24FPS 15.3MB</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1、圣洁的形象有着一丝诡异的感觉，与持双刀的暗伊芙一样，眼睛处有一朵小花，即中二又致敬龙背上的骑兵。<div style=\"\">2、主体像是天使的的风格加哥特，表情玩味，身材也没什么看点，形象、胸、腰、臀、都不亮眼。所以吧略显肉感的腿凸显出来了，裙子也是非常的短，配了除了色气没什么用的腿环，腿环本来是用来塞钱的，不会往腿环里面塞钞票。<span style=\"color:rgb(249,182,71);\">腿确实不错</span>。</div><div style=\"\">3、除了像是水滴宝石漂浮的特效，还有一些半透明的羽毛下落，只能看见轮廓。</div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-width=\"549\" data-height=\"620\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_549/h_620/1069/87565/2023/0/29/988773.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_549/h_620/1069/87565/2023/0/29/988773.gif\" style=\"\"></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">娜迦-蛇女</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">-惊魂一剑 23年02月02日 第44期</span></span></div></div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"1024\" data-height=\"1014\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1024/h_1014/1069/72324/2023/1/1/294078.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1024/h_1014/1069/72324/2023/1/1/294078.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1024/h_1014/1069/72324/2023/1/1/294078.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"2\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">2D演出&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">546×589 24FPS 8.91MB</span></span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、和李施美RD皮一样的主体风格，和风加大蛇这个大家看过很多么什么好说的。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、鞋子是双层高跟鞋，第一层样式类似漆木屐，第二层像是“故意的<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">”</span>保留了一些古风元素的现代高跟鞋。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;衣服和配饰虽然是古风，但衣服下摆更像晚礼服这种衣服大腿迈不开大步伐。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;上衣什么都没穿仔细观察可以发现是被头发挡住了，当你仔细观察熊付的时候，会发现他在用“嫌弃的余光<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">”</span>看你，好家伙你是不是认识一脸嫌弃给你看胖次的女仆。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、动态动作部位不多，慢放可以观察到刀向下挥砍没有砍到头发是趁头发不注意就砍下去了，而收刀没有碰到头发是因为刀条消失再出现，跟光剑似的原力就是真好是吧。</div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"546\" data-height=\"589\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_546/h_589/1069/87565/2023/2/19/177965.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_546/h_589/1069/87565/2023/2/19/177965.gif\"></div></div>\n                               </div></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">贝尔德莱-管家</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">-合作者 23年03月02日</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>第45期</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"751\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_751/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/1/28/438555.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_751/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/1/28/438555.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_751/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/1/28/438555.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"2\"><div><br></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">2D演出 515×813 24FPS 14MB</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1男人、</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">有点帅。</span><div style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">2画面相对多年前的老皮肤简洁了好多，也没有杂乱的动态效果了。</div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"515\" data-height=\"813\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_515/h_813/1069/87565/2023/2/19/193284.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_515/h_813/1069/87565/2023/2/19/193284.gif\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">忒提斯-鲸妈</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">-破茧 23年03月30日</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>第46期&nbsp;</span></div></div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"885\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_885/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/2/29/236846.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_885/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/2/29/236846.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_885/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/2/29/236846.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"1\"><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、整体画面都是低饱和度色调，非常淡雅清新，与之所画出来的角色的身材可以说得上是相反的重磅。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、服装和装饰的风格有点像最近总能看到希腊或者北欧神风格。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、所有物品都有反重力的效果<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">除了胸部</span>，人物像是漂浮在水中待机动作下双腿脚踢打水保持悬浮，被击和攻击动作则会像人鱼一样双腿发力。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、漂浮的裙子上映有水面之下的光影<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">，</span>那么脚下的像水一样的装饰和攻击动作出现的浪花...... 是有一个黄色方块动画片的海底海是吧。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;另一种看法是仔细观察发现飘动的头发看不见阴影，裙子上的光影是对头发阴影的一种美化，代表鲸妈的长发像水一样纯净丝滑。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5、通过对胸部的物理效果观察，以及大腿上部的腿环装饰可以发现，鲸妈的体脂率是比较高的摸起来应该是软软的，与同一时间出的<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">“</span>船长”的氪金皮相反船长的表现更像是紧实的肌肉。</div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">2D演出&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">553×838 24FPS 23.4MB</span></span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\">动作虽然不多但也是最近几个新形象中的佼佼者了</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"553\" data-height=\"838\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_553/h_838/1069/87565/2023/3/8/192183.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_553/h_838/1069/87565/2023/3/8/192183.gif\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;\"></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span>杰米娜</span>-木<span>巫女</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">-<span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">森林魔女</span> 23年04月27日</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>第47期&nbsp;</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"847\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_847/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/3/26/258134.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_847/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/3/26/258134.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_847/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/3/26/258134.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"4\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">2D演出&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">569×849 24FPS 9.35MB</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、涩涩的演出就是一个可以称得上是体位的立绘姿势，和一个被撅了的动作。上一个这么内涵的是木修女（梅加拉）<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">请不要用奇怪的地方点击手机触发立绘动作效果</span>。两位都是金总的画作，而且当时金总还发了推特在练习AI绘图。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、整体全都得绿色调连皮肤都是，有可能是环境光反射显得，更有可能就是偏黄绿的的皮肤，（我看见SD-ai绘图里专门有个画这种绿皮的VAE），<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">盆骨个屁股没有挨着地面如果不考虑擦边球的姿势这动作可太练腹肌了。身材劲爆这个带刺的树藤怎么还玩捆绑啊，是兜住裙子啊那没事了。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:center;\">色而不淫，优雅美丽 是金总主美的风格了</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"569\" data-height=\"849\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_569/h_849/1069/87565/2023/4/14/468310.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_569/h_849/1069/87565/2023/4/14/468310.gif\"></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">薇薇安-VVA</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">-亲切 23年05月25日</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>第48期</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">官方图</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"589\" data-height=\"1024\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_589/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/4/24/389657.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_589/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/4/24/389657.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_589/h_1024/1069/72324/2023/4/24/389657.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"1\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">2D演出&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:20px;\">569×849 24FPS 9.35MB</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"450\" data-height=\"771\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_450/h_771/1069/87565/2023/5/11/74372.gif\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_450/h_771/1069/87565/2023/5/11/74372.gif\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、美丽优雅好诱人的熟女，身材爆炸健康的体型，我以为涩涩要像森魔女的体位立绘和被撅动画，这个薇薇安太可怕了简单的动作无尽的诱惑，一个小臂托胸直接给我干过敏了。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、虽然动作幅度不大但做的非常优秀，表情神态细节很好，攻击动作小臂托胸。待机动作二郎腿姿势的右脚有微微踮脚动作有时会摆出眼神犀利的反差微表情，被击动作娇羞可人（基本不可见）。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、标志性遮阳帽没有带，因为穿的是布料极少的晚礼服，外搭仍然有些像防晒功能的外套，外套半脱好色<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">妻</span>气的说，形象比较休闲慵懒所以不好推测是高跟鞋还是平底鞋，但在这套搭配之下个人感觉区别不大。携戴的手包与服装同是单一元素风格，颜色恰到好处。手包没有拉手着点在这套搭配中也很重要。拎包和手持腋夹是完全两种仪态风格。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、与老八的挫折和涅班的佳印玫瑰属于晚礼服系列，拜托这个RD皮打爆氪金皮好吧，老八的没不动明王RB皮颜值高，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">涅班比较少女鞋子搭配不成熟。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5、这种桌子一般做这个体重的人会翻倒底座太小，但在图中可以看到VVA的背后有一个非常大的花盆平衡重量。</span></div></span></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"></span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">XX-XX</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">-XX 23年XX月XX日</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>第49期</span></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_800/h_925/1069/107851/2023/0/4/882023.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_549/h_620/1069/87565/2023/0/29/988773.gif", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1024/h_1014/1069/72324/2023/1/1/294078.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "不忘初心", "tag_color": "#FEC700"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 87603334, "content_num": 27, "read_num": 1273844, "like_num": 691}, "update_user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.p